ansparency. An alpha value of 00 is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor"}}}